# ABDO Creator OS — environment variables
#
# This file lists the names of every variable the app reads. It contains no
# real secrets — copy it to `.env.local` and fill in your values there.
# `.env`, `.env.local`, and any `*.env.*.local` are git-ignored by default.
#
# Categories
#   Server-only (sensitive):  these are read on the server only, never reach
#                             the browser. They unlock the live providers.
#   Build configuration:      read during `next build`. Used to switch between
#                             static export and the full server build.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-only — AI providers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Google Gemini (writing, analysis, vision, long context)
# Get one at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# DeepSeek (fast, cheap writing)
# Get one at: https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter (multi-model router)
# Get one at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional: force a specific model on the OpenRouter provider.
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-only — research, scraping, YouTube, transcript
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Tavily (web search tuned for AI)
# Get one at: https://app.tavily.com/home
# TAVILY_API_KEY=

# Firecrawl (URL → clean Markdown)
# Get one at: https://www.firecrawl.dev/
# FireCRAWL_API_KEY=

# YouTube Data API v3 (search, video, channel)
# Get one at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=

# Generic video-to-text endpoint (OpenAI-compatible Whisper, AssemblyAI, etc.)
# Configure both an endpoint URL and a key for it.
# VIDEO_TO_TEXT_API_KEY=
# VIDEO_TO_TEXT_ENDPOINT=
# VIDEO_TO_TEXT_MODEL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-only — vault master (encrypts keys persisted on disk)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# If unset, saved keys live in process memory only and disappear on restart.
# Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 32
# ABDO_VAULT_SECRET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Set to "1" to produce a static export (output goes to ./out). Anything else
# keeps the full server build with the API routes.
# ABDO_STATIC=1